<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  ============================================================================
  RUT_VentForge_RecipeWiring.xml         UtinniPatches · FORGE_MECHANICS_1 F6
  ============================================================================
  RUT_VentForge.xml's own header explains why this is a patch rather than a
  copied recipe list: vanilla smithing recipes are not a standalone
  RecipeDef with a <recipes> field on the smithy ThingDef (unlike
  ElectricSmelter) — they are each weapon/apparel ThingDef's own
  <recipeMaker><recipeUsers> entry naming FueledSmithy/ElectricSmithy
  directly (confirmed, Core/Defs/ThingDefs_Misc/Weapons/BaseWeapons.xml:125-135,
  the BaseMeleeWeapon abstract).

  xpath matches on CONTENT (recipeMaker/recipeUsers/li="FueledSmithy"),
  not on a hand-maintained list of defNames — so this one Add operation
  reaches every weapon and apparel ThingDef that names FueledSmithy today
  (melee weapons, ranged neolithic weapons, tailored apparel — confirmed
  hits in BaseWeapons.xml, RangedNeolithic.xml, Apparel_Various.xml,
  Apparel_Headgear.xml this pass) AND automatically mirrors anything a
  future DLC or mod adds the same way, which a static copied list could
  not — genuinely "mirrors the fueled vanilla equivalent," not a snapshot
  of it.

  RUT_VentForge only exists when mandrake.rm.environmentalhazards is
  active. Gate: PatchOperationFindMod on the kit's display name. ⚠️
  MayRequire on an <Operation> is INERT (MEASURED 2026-09-17 against 1.6
  source — ModContentPack.LoadPatches never reads the attribute); this
  operation's own xpath matches recipeUsers content that exists regardless
  of the gated mod, so without a real gate the appended <li> would be a
  dangling defName on every affected recipeUsers list the moment it is
  not. FindMod is the only real per-operation gate.
  ============================================================================
-->
<Patch>

  <Operation Class="PatchOperationFindMod">
    <mods>
      <li>RimMandrake: Environmental Hazards Kit</li>
    </mods>
    <match Class="PatchOperationAdd">
      <xpath>/Defs/ThingDef[recipeMaker/recipeUsers/li="FueledSmithy"]/recipeMaker/recipeUsers</xpath>
      <value>
        <li>RUT_VentForge</li>
      </value>
    </match>
  </Operation>

</Patch>
